{"seq":6,"slug":"lc0214-shortest-palindrome","title":"LeetCode 214 最短回文串","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/leetcode-practice/hard-backtracking-string/lc0214-shortest-palindrome","wordCount":780,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"leetcode-214-最短回文串\">LeetCode 214 最短回文串</h1><h2 id=\"题目描述\">题目描述</h2><p>给定一个字符串 <code>s</code>，通过在字符串前面添加字符将其转换为回文串。要求找到并返回可以用这种方式构建的最短回文串。</p>\n<p><strong>示例：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"输入：s = &quot;aacecaaa&quot;&#10;输出：&quot;aaacecaaa&quot;&#10;解释：在前面添加一个 &#39;a&#39; 即可&#10;&#10;输入：s = &quot;abcd&quot;&#10;输出：&quot;dcbabcd&quot;&#10;解释：在前面添加 &quot;dcb&quot;&#10;&#10;输入：s = &quot;&quot;&#10;输出：&quot;&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>输入：s = \"aacecaaa\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>输出：\"aaacecaaa\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>解释：在前面添加一个 'a' 即可</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>输入：s = \"abcd\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>输出：\"dcbabcd\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>解释：在前面添加 \"dcb\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>输入：s = \"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>输出：\"\"</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>约束条件：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>0 &lt;= s.length &lt;= 5 × 10⁴</code></li>\n<li><code>s</code> 仅由小写英文字母组成</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"解题思路\">解题思路</h2><p>问题的本质是：找到字符串 <code>s</code> 从位置 0 开始的最长回文前缀。设这个最长回文前缀的长度为 <code>L</code>，则只需将 <code>s[L:]</code> 反转后拼接到 <code>s</code> 前面即可得到最短回文串。</p>\n<p><strong>暴力方法：</strong> 从 <code>s</code> 的末尾开始，逐步缩短，检查 <code>s[0..i]</code> 是否为回文。找到最大的 <code>i</code> 即为最长回文前缀。时间复杂度 O(n²)。</p>\n<p><strong>KMP 方法：</strong> 构造字符串 <code>t = s + &#39;#&#39; + reverse(s)</code>，对 <code>t</code> 求 KMP 的 next 数组。<code>next</code> 数组的最后一个值就是 <code>s</code> 的最长回文前缀的长度。</p>\n<p>这是因为 <code>t</code> 的前缀来自 <code>s</code>，<code>t</code> 的后缀来自 <code>reverse(s)</code>。<code>t</code> 的最长相等前后缀就意味着 <code>s</code> 的某个前缀等于 <code>reverse(s)</code> 的某个后缀——而 <code>reverse(s)</code> 的后缀等于 <code>s</code> 的前缀的反转——这恰好就是回文前缀的定义。</p>\n<p>中间的 <code>&#39;#&#39;</code> 分隔符是必要的，防止 next 值超过 <code>s</code> 的长度。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>时间复杂度</th>\n<th>空间复杂度</th>\n<th>核心思想</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>暴力检查</td>\n<td>O(n²)</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>逐一检查每个前缀是否回文</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>KMP</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>构造 s + &#39;#&#39; + rev(s)，取 next 末值</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Rabin-Karp 哈希</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>O(1)</td>\n<td>滚动哈希同时计算正反向</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Manacher</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>求最长回文串，取包含首字符的</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>KMP 方法详细推导：</strong></p>\n<p>以 <code>s = &quot;aacecaaa&quot;</code> 为例：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>reverse(s) = &quot;aaacecaa&quot;</code></li>\n<li><code>t = &quot;aacecaaa#aaacecaa&quot;</code></li>\n<li>对 <code>t</code> 构建 next 数组，最后一个值为 7</li>\n<li>这意味着 <code>s[0..6] = &quot;aacecaa&quot;</code> 是回文前缀（长度 7）</li>\n<li>只需将 <code>s[7:] = &quot;a&quot;</code> 反转后加到前面：<code>&quot;a&quot; + &quot;aacecaaa&quot; = &quot;aaacecaaa&quot;</code></li>\n</ul>\n<p>实际上 <code>s[0..6] = &quot;aacecaa&quot;</code> 确实是回文，验证成功。</p>\n<h2 id=\"代码实现\">代码实现</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function shortestPalindrome(s: string): string {&#10;  if (s.length &lt;= 1) return s;&#10;&#10;  const rev = s.split(&#39;&#39;).reverse().join(&#39;&#39;);&#10;  const combined = s + &#39;#&#39; + rev;&#10;&#10;  const next = buildNext(combined);&#10;  const palindromeLen = next[combined.length - 1];&#10;&#10;  const suffix = s.slice(palindromeLen);&#10;  const prefix = suffix.split(&#39;&#39;).reverse().join(&#39;&#39;);&#10;&#10;  return prefix + s;&#10;}&#10;&#10;function buildNext(pattern: string): number[] {&#10;  const n = pattern.length;&#10;  const next: number[] = new Array(n).fill(0);&#10;&#10;  let len = 0;&#10;  let i = 1;&#10;&#10;  while (i &lt; n) {&#10;    if (pattern[i] === pattern[len]) {&#10;      len++;&#10;      next[i] = len;&#10;      i++;&#10;    } else if (len &gt; 0) {&#10;      len = next[len - 1];&#10;    } else {&#10;      i++;&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  return next;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> shortestPalindrome</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">s</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (s.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> s;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> rev</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> s.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">split</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">''</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">reverse</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">join</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">''</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> combined</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> s </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '#'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> +</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> rev;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> next</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> buildNext</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(combined);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> palindromeLen</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> next[combined.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> suffix</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> s.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">slice</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(palindromeLen);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> prefix</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> suffix.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">split</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">''</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">reverse</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">join</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">''</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> prefix </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> s;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> buildNext</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">pattern</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[] {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> n</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pattern.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> next</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Array</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(n).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">fill</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> len </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  while</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (pattern[i] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pattern[len]) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      len</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      next[i] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> len;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      i</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">else</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (len </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      len </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> next[len </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">else</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      i</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> next;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>实现要点：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>构造组合串</strong>：<code>s + &#39;#&#39; + reverse(s)</code> 中的 <code>&#39;#&#39;</code> 必须是不在 <code>s</code> 中出现的字符，确保 next 值不会跨越分隔符。</li>\n<li><strong>next 数组末值</strong>：<code>next[combined.length - 1]</code> 就是从位置 0 开始的最长回文前缀长度。</li>\n<li><strong>结果拼接</strong>：将非回文后缀 <code>s[palindromeLen:]</code> 反转后放在 <code>s</code> 前面。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Rabin-Karp 哈希方法</strong>是另一种优雅的解法：同时从左到右计算正向哈希和反向哈希，每处理到位置 <code>i</code>，如果两个哈希值相等，则 <code>s[0..i]</code> 是回文前缀候选。记录最后一个匹配位置即为答案。这种方法空间复杂度为 O(1)（不计结果字符串），但需要处理哈希冲突的问题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"复杂度分析\">复杂度分析</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>复杂度</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>时间</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>构建组合串 O(n)，KMP 预处理 O(n)，字符串拼接 O(n)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>空间</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>组合串长度 2n+1，next 数组长度 2n+1</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>本题展示了 KMP next 数组在字符串匹配之外的巧妙应用。通过构造辅助字符串，将&quot;求最长回文前缀&quot;转化为&quot;求最长相等前后缀&quot;问题，后者恰好是 next 数组的直接含义。这种问题转化的思维方式在算法竞赛中非常常见——当直接求解困难时，尝试将问题转化为已有工具可以处理的形式。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"LeetCode 214 最短回文串","id":"leetcode-214-最短回文串"},{"level":2,"text":"题目描述","id":"题目描述"},{"level":2,"text":"解题思路","id":"解题思路"},{"level":2,"text":"代码实现","id":"代码实现"},{"level":2,"text":"复杂度分析","id":"复杂度分析"}],"prev":{"title":"LeetCode 28 KMP 字符串匹配","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/leetcode-practice/hard-backtracking-string/lc0028-kmp-implementation"},"next":{"title":"LeetCode 336 回文对","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/leetcode-practice/hard-backtracking-string/lc0336-palindrome-pairs"}}